# Three rooms joined by narrow doors (1.2 m wide, drone is 0.6 m across).
# Forces an S-shaped route, which is hard for uniform-sampling RRT.
bounds 20 12
radius 0.3
start 2 2
goal 18 10

# wall 1, door near the top
rect 6 0 6.5 9.5
rect 6 10.7 6.5 12
# wall 2, door near the bottom
rect 13 2.5 13.5 12
rect 13 0 13.5 1.3
# furniture
circle 9.5 4 1.2
rect 15.5 5 18 6
